@@ -41,0 +42,7 @@ toolchain experiment and bypasses the active pin.
+The pinned compiler itself is built with `-Doptimize=ReleaseFast`. A default
+`zig build` produces a Debug compiler and makes even fully cached guest tests
+several times slower. To prepare a replacement installation, build Mylang with
+`zig build -Doptimize=ReleaseFast --prefix /path/to/install`, verify it, then
+register that complete install with `tools/update-toolchain.sh`. This compiler
+build setting is separate from the guest application's LLVM optimization mode.
